sequenceDiagram
    participant Phone
    participant Mac
    Phone->>Mac: Authenticated GET capability (read only)
    Mac-->>Phone: Server incarnation and issuance time
    Phone->>Mac: POST with stable operation UUID + incarnation + time
    Mac->>Mac: Authenticate device, validate window, reserve operation
    Mac->>Mac: Execute once, retain original response
    Mac--xPhone: First response lost
    Phone->>Mac: Same POST via another saved address
    Mac-->>Phone: Original response; no second mutation
    Note over Phone,Mac: Restart, expiry, legacy server or uncertain result: stop and show check-before-retry error
